{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y 在 S08、S10、S11、S12 这些短时段里，话与到时出现的感受都比较密集，观众可能来不及消化；X 的右侧短词组更容易快速扫过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用【】把每段真正重要的心理节点突出出来，观众更容易抓住他从不甘、怀念、孤独到逐渐接纳的变化。尤其是 S04、S09、S12，Y 把怀念与委屈如何纠缠、想回去究竟在想什么、最后如何不再逼自己选边讲得更清楚，前后也始终围绕「被当作自己人」这一核心情感展开。感受部分的音乐时点、身体反应和具体意象也比 X 丰富细腻，虽然短屏段有些拥挤，但整体听音乐时获得的情绪层次和人物理解仍然是 Y 更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "668a87d5-cc18-4e54-bbca-27dda7b672d2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T001833709731Z", "elapsed_seconds": 59.594, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:19:33.308872+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9cef5e6d990edad8876ef26d2eecd5406cbf86236994451e807c8e4a0ac8ae7f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb